abstract: >-
  Framework-agnostic guard at the tool-call boundary of AI agents: deterministic policy, a
  stricter-only Decider, budgets, and a tamper-evident replayable log mapped to PROV-O and OpenTelemetry.
keywords: [ai-safety, agents, guardrails, provenance, prov-o, opentelemetry]
